evidence = "tools/hyperfide/spec/hyperfide-source-control/spec.kvx:200 requires current layout qualification, but require_layout_receipt at tools/hyperfide/tests/hyperfide/cases/source_control/0_10.py:233 validates only schema, PASS, mapping digest and generation without comparing the snapshot and subtree captured at tools/hyperfide/tests/hyperfide/cases/source_control/0_9.py:46 or repeating scoped cleanliness at 0_9.py:422, so the stale-source gap introduced by commit 34c8243fbb04238f2e9ca95cbb94ea32029c5b70 remains."
close_comment = "The fleet prerequisite still accepts a retained layout PASS receipt after relevant source changes when the mapping is unchanged. A repair task will bind receipt acceptance to current layout source and scoped cleanliness, with regression coverage that preserves tolerance for unrelated changes outside the Hyperfide root."

